────────────────────
+ This
    - vector [F64]

= This(RGBA([vector[0], vector[1], vector[2], vector[3]]), max(0.0, vector[4]), vector[5])

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is Animatable ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ get motion-vector [F64]

[paint[0], paint[1], paint[2], paint[3], width as F64, offset as F64]

.. paint = color.motion-vector

────────────────────
+ get motion-none-vector [F64]

